1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:05,840
Hello priya i am your aunt calling tell me
about plans for sunday

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:11,440
I wanted to tell you everything in one
message so that you don't forget.

3
00:00:11,540 --> 00:00:17,140
First at your uncle's house function will
start at eleven am

4
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:20,660
Not at ten as we said before

5
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:24,820
If you can come by ten thirty

6
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:29,720
Because we need help with setting up
chairs and flowers.

7
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:35,920
Your grandmother has ordered her knitted
shawl it is in the guest room steel
wardrobe

8
00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:42,920
The second shelf is on it bring that with
you about the third food

9
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:48,800
Order a lunch for forty people from the
caterer near the bus stand

10
00:00:49,020 --> 00:00:54,500
They will deliver at twelve thirty your
mom is making sweets at home

11
00:00:54,660 --> 00:01:00,320
So you don't need to buy anything from the
store if you are coming by train

12
00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:06,900
So catch the train of eight fifteen and
get off at main station your cousin

13
00:01:06,940 --> 00:01:12,720
Will john come to pick you up with his car
does he have the same phone number as
before

14
00:01:13,040 --> 00:01:19,020
If the train is late call him he will wait
one more thing

15
00:01:19,300 --> 00:01:25,460
According to the weather department it may
rain in the afternoon so take an umbrella
with you

16
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:32,960
Last time everyone got wet and children
caught cold along with their brother .

17
00:01:32,980 --> 00:01:39,860
Remind grandma to bring the wedding
pictures she wants to show them to the
guests

18
00:01:39,880 --> 00:01:46,440
Now, regarding gifts, we have decided that
instead of everyone giving many small
gifts.

19
00:01:46,540 --> 00:01:48,440
Give a gift together

20
00:01:48,720 --> 00:01:54,560
Your share is five hundred rupees you can
send it to your mom from phone

21
00:01:54,860 --> 00:02:01,820
And she will give it to rabi who is buying
a gift on saturday please don't bring any
other gifts separately

22
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:03,840
Otherwise, Grandma, we all

23
00:02:03,840 --> 00:02:10,480
If you want to spend a lot of money, then
stay in the upper room.

24
00:02:10,480 --> 00:02:15,580
Can sleep with your cousins extra blanket
is also there

25
00:02:15,580 --> 00:02:21,200
But now the nights are cold so bring a
sweater on monday morning

26
00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:25,460
Will rabi drop you back at the station for
the nine o'clock train

27
00:02:25,500 --> 00:02:32,440
So that you get home before lunch to meet
you after such a long time

28
00:02:32,440 --> 00:02:38,460
We are all very excited, your grandmother
keeps asking when will you come.

29
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:44,860
Please call me after eight p. m. tonight
and tell me what time you will arrive

30
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:50,280
Take care have a safe trip and see you on
sunday
